            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Stereoisomers have the same chemical formula and the same bonds but differ in the arrangement of the ligands in space. Complexes show two types of stereoisomerism: geometrical (cis-trans) isomerism and optical isomerism."
          },
          {
